Problem Statement: Customer Query Classification Using Prompt Engineering
An e-commerce company receives numerous customer queries related to orders,
deliveries, payments, refunds, cancellations, and product defects. Your task is to design
an effective prompt that classifies each customer query into the appropriate predefined
category.
Input: A customer query in natural language.
Output: A single word representing the category of the query.
Categories:
• Delivery
• Shipping
• Refund
• Payment
• Cancellation
• Defect
• Return
• Account
• Unknown
Examples:

Input Query Expected Output

My order has not arrived yet. Delivery
My package is stuck in transit. Shipping
I haven't received my money back. Refund
Money was deducted twice from my account. Payment
I want to cancel my order. Cancellation
The product I received is broken. Defect
I want to send this product back. Return
I cannot log in to my account. Account
What is the capital of India? Unknown

Constraint: The output must contain exactly one category word, without explanations,
punctuation, or additional text.

Prompt:
create an AI-based customer query classification system for an e-commerce company. Its task is to read and understand customer queries and classify them into one of the following nine categories:

Delivery
Shipping
Refund
Payment
Cancellation
Defect
Return
Account
Unknown
The system must understand the customer's query, identify the main issue, and select the most appropriate category based on its meaning.

It must consider the context of the complete sentence rather than just individual keywords. If a query does not match any of the given categories, it must classify it as Unknown.

The chatbot must always respond with exactly one word, using only the predefined category names. It must not provide explanations, suggestions, or additional information.

Examples:

Where is my order? → Delivery
My payment failed → Payment
I want my money back → Refund
Cancel my order → Cancellation
My product is broken → Defect
I want to return my shoes → Return
I cannot log in → Account
What is the weather today? → Unknown
The system must perform only the classification task and return one appropriate category for every customer query.
